    "text": "By Jennifer Best Contributing Writer ,\n5 hours ago The cities of Buellton and Solvang have begun exploring a potential change in law enforcement contractors, a move that could end Solvang’s 41-year working relationship with Santa Barbara County Sheriff’s Office. On Monday, Solvang council members unanimously directed staff to advance discussions with the City of Lompoc for... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
